</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>It is nothing good that is of myself, (Just the Christ, in you and me,)</l><l>Nothing of my natural life, (The Christ who’s all to be,)</l><l>Not the best of fruit from the knowledge tree, (Only Christ we’d know,)</l><l>That can touch your life, or turn your heart, (Christ can touch your life,)</l><l>Refresh you in your deepest part,</l><l>But it’s Christ, just the Christ, (Just this Christ,)</l><l>Lived out through me. (Just the Christ in me.)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
